      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0101",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "To use the following examples, you must have the AWS CLI installed and configured. See the [[p0]] in the [[p1]]AWS CLI User Guide[[p2]] for more information.",
      "protected": [
        {
          "token": "[[p0]]",
          "inline": {
            "tag": "link",
            "text": "Getting started guide",
            "href": "https://docs.aws.amazon.com/cli/latest/userguide/cli-chap-getting-started.html"
          }
        },
        {
          "token": "[[p1]]",
          "inline": {
            "tag": "style-open",
            "style": "em"
          }
        },
        {
          "token": "[[p2]]",
          "inline": {
            "tag": "style-close",
            "style": "em"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s0102",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Unless otherwise stated, all examples have unix-like quotation rules. These examples will need to be adapted to your terminal’s quoting rules. See [[p0]] in the [[p1]]AWS CLI User Guide[[p2]] .",
      "protected": [
        {
          "token": "[[p0]]",
          "inline": {
            "tag": "link",
            "text": "Using quotation marks with strings",
            "href": "https://docs.aws.amazon.com/cli/latest/userguide/cli-usage-parameters-quoting-strings.html"
          }
        },
        {
          "token": "[[p1]]",
          "inline": {
            "tag": "style-open",
            "style": "em"
          }
        },
        {
          "token": "[[p2]]",
          "inline": {
            "tag": "style-close",
            "style": "em"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s0103",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "[[p0]]To update the service setting for Parameter Store throughput[[p1]]",
      "protected": [
        {
          "token": "[[p0]]",
          "inline": {
            "tag": "style-open",
            "style": "strong"
          }
        },
        {
          "token": "[[p1]]",
          "inline": {
            "tag": "style-close",
            "style": "strong"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s0104",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "The following [[p0]] example updates the current service setting for Parameter Store throughput in the specified region to use increased throughput.",
      "protected": [
        {
          "token": "[[p0]]",
          "inline": {
            "tag": "code",
            "text": "update-service-setting"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s0105",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "This command produces no output.",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0106",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "For more information, see [[p0]] in the [[p1]]AWS Systems Manager User Guide[[p2]].",
      "protected": [
        {
          "token": "[[p0]]",
          "inline": {
            "tag": "link",
            "text": "Increasing Parameter Store Throughput",
            "href": "https://docs.aws.amazon.com/systems-manager/latest/userguide/parameter-store-throughput.html"
          }
        },
        {
